    "en": [
      "The postcard features a black and white image of a large, chateau-like building with steeply pitched roofs and dormer windows, situated in a forested and hilly landscape. A winding path lines the left side of the image, flanked by tall trees and greenery, leading toward the building in the distance. There is no visible text on the front of the postcard."
